WEBVTT

1
00:00.400 --> 00:02.151
JavaScript has fewer types.

2
00:02.151 --> 00:07.066
There is one type number for whole numbers and decimals, and no separate type for one character.

3
00:07.066 --> 00:14.620
A variable without a value is undefined. That looks like null, but null is something you set yourself, on purpose.

4
00:14.620 --> 00:18.932
Objects and arrays are complex types. They come in a later chapter.
